  "source": "def insertion_sort(nums):\n    for i in range(1, len(nums)):\n        key = nums[i]\n        j = i - 1\n        while j >= 0 and nums[j] > key:\n            nums[j + 1] = nums[j]\n            j = j - 1\n        nums[j + 1] = key\n    return nums\n\nnums = [9, 4, 7, 1, 3, 8]\nprint(insertion_sort(nums))\n",
